      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A square-wave Oscillator jumps between two levels. The gold dot follows it raw; the blue one follows it through a Slew, which eases toward each new level instead of jumping. The Output's own last frame, slid left, draws both paths. Turn the Slew's Rise and Fall, or set its Shape to Rate for a straight ramp with a corner."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
